  "summary": "The experiment tested a multimodal model combining RNA data encoded with pca_n2000 and image data encoded with resnet50 via simple concatenation fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 suggests the configuration achieves a baseline performance for multimodal integration, with validation F1 of 0.5104 supporting this trend. The effectiveness of this specific fusion strategy and encoder combination remains uncertain without comparative benchmarks."
}

